OL,3,GNEWSATheatre closing down due to
OL,4,A'challenging time'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community theatre has announced its
OL,7,Fclosure after entering voluntary
OL,8,Fliquidation.
OL,10,FSterts Theatre CIC said its board had
OL,11,Ftaken the "difficult decision" to place
OL,12,Fit into creditors' voluntary
OL,13,Fliquidation amid an "exceptionally
OL,14,Fchallenging time for cultural and arts
OL,15,Forganisations".
OL,17,FIn a statement on social media, the
OL,18,Forganisation said it was with "immense
OL,19,Fsadness" it was announcing the closure,
OL,20,Fadding it was "deeply grateful" to
OL,21,Feverybody who had been part of it.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
