OL,3,GNEWSATheatre closing down due to
OL,4,A'challenging time'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaula Every, who has been involved with
OL,7,Fthe theatre in Upton Cross in the past,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's a lovely theatre now and it
OL,9,Fwould be really sad if it wasn't used
OL,10,Fby the community which is who it should
OL,11,Fbe being used by."
